<view class="container">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">欢迎来到校园心理健康中心</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">我们致力于为每一位同学提供专业、温暖的心理支持服务</view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">我们的服务</view>
    <view class="service-grid">
      <view class="service-item" bindtap="goToCounselors">
        <view class="service-icon">👨‍⚕️</view>
        <view class="service-name">专业咨询</view>
        <view class="service-desc">预约专业心理咨询师</view>
      </view>
      <view class="service-item" bindtap="goToScl90">
        <view class="service-icon">📊</view>
        <view class="service-name">心理测评</view>
        <view class="service-desc">SCL-90专业量表</view>
      </view>
      <view class="service-item" bindtap="goToConfessions">
        <view class="service-icon">💬</view>
        <view class="service-name">匿名倾诉</view>
        <view class="service-desc">安全说出心里话</view>
      </view>
      <view class="service-item" bindtap="goToAppointments">
        <view class="service-icon">📝</view>
        <view class="service-name">预约记录</view>
        <view class="service-desc">查看历史预约</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="section bg-light">
    <view class="section-title">关于心理健康</view>
    <view class="content-card">
      <text class="content-text">心理健康是整体健康的重要组成部分。无论你是面临学业压力、人际关系困扰，还是只是想找人聊聊，我们都在这里陪伴你。</text>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <text class="content-text highlight">请记住：寻求帮助是勇敢的表现，而不是软弱的象征。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view class="emergency-card">
    <view class="emergency-icon">📞</view>
    <view class="emergency-content">
      <view class="emergency-title">心理援助热线</view>
      <view class="emergency-phone">400-161-9995</view>
      <view class="emergency-desc">24小时全天候服务</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
